  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -250,6 +250,14 @@ an alias for the protocol and all its fields.\n \n === New and Updated Capture Interface support\n \n+* `etwdump` now supports new capture providers, among which:\n+  * un-encrypted LDAP messages\n+  * un-encrypted SMB client/server messages\n+  * un-encrypted HTTPS messages (from both WinInet and WinHTTP)\n+\n+* `etwdump` now supports capture options and has a much better support of\n+  undecipherable messages.\n+\n // [commaize]\n // --\n // --\n",
